    "    magus buzz hack/dev/bootstrap-worktree.buzz -- --job <%& id %>",
    "",
    "It places the orchestrator's `./magus` (it never builds one), builds the graph, takes the lease and refuses unless the row names this worktree and its base. "
        + "If it refuses, stop and report the blocking reason and evidence ref; do not paste the full verdict or take the lease by hand somewhere else.",
    "",
    "The guard grades your writes under the lease only once it has bound your session: at a spawn titled for this job, "
        + "or when it sees you run `./magus job exec <%& id %>` yourself. Not spawned under it? Run that once after the script.",
    "",
    "## Write paths",
    "",
    "<%#readOnly%>",
    "- none: this job is read-only, so write nothing in the tree",
    "<%/readOnly%>",
    "<%#writePaths%>",
    "- `<%& . %>`",
    "<%/writePaths%>",
    "",
    "## Deny paths",
    "",
    "Never write these, whatever your write paths say; a lease that owns one is worked by its own holder.",
    "",
    "<%#denyLines%>",
    "<%& . %>",
    "<%/denyLines%>",
    "- derived by the workspace (generated files, other leases, shared build inputs): `./magus describe job <%& id %>` lists them",
    "",
    "## Read paths",
    "",
    "<%#readPaths%>",
    "- `<%& . %>`",
    "<%/readPaths%>",
    "<%^readPaths%>",
    "- none declared: read what the criteria need, through the graph first",
    "<%/readPaths%>",
    "",
    "## Other jobs",
    "",
    "<%#alone%>",
    "- none depends on or overlaps this one",
    "<%/alone%>",
    "<%#dependencies%>",
    "<%& line %>",
    "<%/dependencies%>",
    "<%#overlaps%>",
    "<%& line %>",
    "<%/overlaps%>",
    "",
    "## Check",
    "",
    "<%#check%>",
    "Your one check, run exactly like this:",
    "",
    "    <%& check %>",
    "<%/check%>",
    "<%^check%>",
    "The spec names no check: the goals above grade the work.",
    "<%/check%>",
    "",
    "Run nothing else that validates: no `magus affected ci`, no other target, no raw tool. The root runs everything else, serially.",
    "If the build budget refuses your check, set validation.owed to `no seat` and leave output_ref empty; mark any verification_evidence the same way. Do not wait or retry; the root runs the owed check.",
    "",
    "## Finish",
    "",
    "Write `<%& id %>-result.json` in your scratchpad directory, outside your write paths; the job id in the name keeps it apart "
        + "from other workers sharing that directory. Fill in the output ref your passing check printed; `./magus job exit --schema` prints the schema:",
    "",
    "```json",
    "\{",
    "  \"schema_version\": <%& resultSchema %>,",
    "  \"job\": \"<%& id %>\",",
    "  \"changed_paths\": <%& changed %>,",
    "  \"validation\": \{\"command\": \"<%& checkJSON %>\", \"output_ref\": \"<the ref the check printed>\"\},",
    "  \"verification_evidence\": [",
